# armour/man/leather_hang: the studded leather skirt: a hip band and two boiled flaps over the thighs, a stitch line
# above the hem, studs (`when studs`) as one course along the lit hip band. Below the band the tunic's own skirts show in cloth1 at the sides
# and back (i2: a leather look reads leather over cloth, not brown from cap to boots). The flaps hinge like plate tassets (STYLE_P2 25.6): `wide` opens them over the
# stride, `flare` trails them, the lie lays them along the thighs; seated keys keep the rest flaps. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role armour leather
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
z 10

